{"about":["The Ancient Seal of Terrabruma has shattered, unleashing the forces of Chaos once more. As one of the last Mages of Wizordum sanctuary, you must embark on a quest to find the source of this corruption and push the Chaos back before they consume the kingdom in a speedrun-friendly fantasy FPS tearing a page from the spellbooks of ‘90s fantasy FPS classics like Hexen and Heretic.","KEY FEATURES","- A vast arsenal of magic weapons & items","- Search for secret places filled with treasures","- Solve puzzles and avoid traps","- Embark on a single-player campaign to find the source of Chaos, traveling from the Town of Grimbrook through swamps over the snowy mountains and beyond.","- Collect bonus items and beat the hardest difficulty levels to climb to the top of the leaderboards","- Beat challenges at each level","- Compete online for the best time","Offline single player","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/7d48dff29530956255a6069e95644f39c162b2d5ebd684d2.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/7d48dff29530956255a6069e95644f39c162b2d5ebd684d2.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/3d3b19e49bd340107ad8c0769bab0ba75c86e5d3b94e9074.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/3d3b19e49bd340107ad8c0769bab0ba75c86e5d3b94e9074.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/4ebd54b7acb26c56ea4b7239245a75fa14129d23b4fb2318.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202508/1815/4ebd54b7acb26c56ea4b7239245a75fa14129d23b4fb2318.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vu